{"id":"ccbc15:problem:4-25","answer":"FACTORING","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>把每个字的笔画顺序写出来，再和“糳”字的笔画顺序比对一下，会发现他们笔画顺序都包含在“糳”的笔画顺序中并且有唯一的序列。</p>","text":"把每个字的笔画顺序写出来，再和“糳”字的笔画顺序比对一下，会发现他们笔画顺序都包含在“糳”的笔画顺序中并且有唯一的序列。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"该如何提取","html":"<p>提取加粗笔画在上一步中的顺序，转字母。</p>","text":"提取加粗笔画在上一步中的顺序，转字母。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"media_only","html":"<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-6d07d1400d8ae4c5d590ce65\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/4/cccdac8f27e64e7bb0fd4cd7b34ed49e.webp\" width=\"800\"/></p>","text":"","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-6d07d1400d8ae4c5d590ce65"]},"extended":{"html":"<p>你要离开之前，获得了一份旅游指南，你注意到其中一句话被圈了出来：“这里的气候大会曾谈论过海平面上升的威胁。”</p>","text":"你要离开之前，获得了一份旅游指南，你注意到其中一句话被圈了出来：“这里的气候大会曾谈论过海平面上升的威胁。”","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem","content-type":0},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-6d07d1400d8ae4c5d590ce65","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/4/cccdac8f27e64e7bb0fd4cd7b34ed49e.webp","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc15/images/4/cccdac8f27e64e7bb0fd4cd7b34ed49e.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":14322,"sha256":"16031b5c3cbaa9e439845e4c509b38cf76376ad9135dffd2d7e30ee666ca676e","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
